00:03:08.721 --> 00:03:11.024 align:start size:94% position:6%
If you're 17 and you're up
watching Seth right now

00:03:11.024 --> 00:03:14.260 align:start size:94% position:6%
because there's
no school to go tomorrow,

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:18.831 align:start size:94% position:6%
