if you turn 18 by January 5th.

00:03:18.831 --> 00:03:21.868 align:start size:94% position:6%
You could register right now
at 17 years old.

00:03:21.868 --> 00:03:24.571
So these are the things we nee
to be active and involved in

00:03:24.571 --> 00:03:29.542 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we've got more work to do,
but we get to play offense

00:03:29.542 --> 00:03:35.548 align:start size:94% position:6%
We get the -- The quarterback,
in his heart, is with us.

00:03:35.548 --> 00:03:39.686 align:start size:94% position:6%
And that's not a bad thing
Not a bad thing at all.

00:03:39.686 --> 00:03:43.456 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I don't want to leave
without you having a chanc

00:03:43.456 --> 00:03:45.491 align:start size:94% position:6%
to be pessimistic
